@startuml
title UML state machine diagram - Farm Management System

[*] --> SignIn : [Enter credentials]
state SignIn <<choice>>
SignIn --> MainArea : [Successful login]
SignIn --> Error : [Invalid credentials]

MainArea --> MarketConditions : [Select market conditions]
MainArea --> PestControlHelp : [Select pest control help]
MainArea --> SoilInfo : [Provide soil information]
MainArea --> WeatherInsights : [Provide location]
MainArea --> LabourAvailability : [Provide location]

state MarketConditions <<choice>>
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : [Select market report]

state PestControlHelp <<choice>>
PestControlHelp --> Techniques : [Provide photo]

state SoilInfo <<choice>>
SoilInfo --> SuitableCrops : [Receive soil information]

state WeatherInsights <<choice>>
WeatherInsights --> Details : [Based on provided location]

state LabourAvailability <<choice>>
LabourAvailability --> Details : [After receiving a location]

MainArea --> Continue : [Continue using the service]
SignIn --> Logout : [Log out]

title UML state machine diagram - Online Marketplace

[*] --> Registration : [Complete registration and verification]
state Registration <<choice>>
Registration --> SellerWorkspace : [Join as a seller]
Registration --> CustomerDashboard : [Join as a customer]

SellerWorkspace --> AddProducts : [Add new products]
SellerWorkspace --> PromoteProducts : [Promote existing products]
SellerWorkspace --> Communicate : [Communicate with customers]
SellerWorkspace --> Logout : [Log out]

CustomerDashboard --> ExploreProducts : [Explore products on the platform]
CustomerDashboard --> SearchAndView : [Search and view available products]
CustomerDashboard --> Purchase : [Proceed with a purchase]
CustomerDashboard --> Browse : [Stop browsing]
CustomerDashboard --> Logout : [Log out]

title UML state machine diagram - Equihealth

[*] --> SignIn : [Enter credentials]
state SignIn <<choice>>
SignIn --> PatientDashboard : [Completed registration and verification]
SignIn --> Error : [Invalid credentials]

PatientDashboard --> MedicalInfo : [Provide medical information]
HealthWorkerDashboard --> CheckAndUseInfo : [Check and use the medical information provided by patients for further analysis]
GovernmentOfficialDashboard --> HealthPlanningResults : [Display health planning results (from the analysis) to government officials]

PatientDashboard --> Alerts : [Prepare alerts based on the analyzed information, which may be sent to either the patient or the health worker]
HealthWorkerDashboard --> PlannedActivities : [Show planned activities (from the analysis)]

PatientDashboard --> Logout : [Log out after they complete their tasks]

title UML state machine diagram - Business Process Outsourcing Bpo Management System Scenario 1

[*] --> UserType : [Choose whether they are a new user or an already registered user]
state UserType <<choice>>
UserType --> NewUserRegistration : [New user]
UserType --> Login : [Registered user]

NewUserRegistration --> RegistrationSuccess : [Save the user's information after a successful registration and allow them to log in]
NewUserRegistration --> RegistrationError : [Require new users to enter their details for registration and end the process if the details are invalid]

Login --> LoginSuccess : [Allow registered users to directly log in by entering their username and password and continue if the login is successful]
Login --> LoginError : [Invalid credentials]

UserProfileManagement --> EditDetails : [Manage their profile after logging in, which includes editing details, uploading or accepting requests, searching for other users, or viewing current deals]
UserProfileManagement --> Logout : [Require users to log out after they complete any action]
@enduml
